sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Scheduler / CLI
    participant O as Patrol Orchestrator
    participant M as contribbot MCP
    participant A as Analyzer
    participant I as Investigator
    participant U as Maintainer
    participant E as Action Executor
    participant V as Verifier
    participant R as Audit Recorder

    S->>O: start patrol(repo)
    O->>R: Run queued → observing
    O->>M: config, dashboard, todos, upstream, CI, security, knowledge
    M-->>O: observation snapshot + coverage
    O->>R: save snapshot
    O->>A: analyze(snapshot, repo knowledge)
    A-->>O: findings + investigation requests + actions

    loop until evidence is sufficient or limit reached
        O->>I: investigate request
        I->>M: PR / Issue / CI / commit / compare lookup
        M-->>I: additional evidence
        I-->>O: evidence references
        O->>A: revise judgment
        A-->>O: updated findings and actions
    end

    O->>R: Run → awaiting_confirmation
    O->>U: evidence + impact + proposed action + risk
    alt approved local Todo / knowledge proposal
        U-->>O: approve
        O->>R: Action → executing
        O->>E: execute through MCP
        E->>M: todo_add / knowledge proposal
        M-->>E: tool result
        E-->>V: claimed result
        V->>M: read back target state
        M-->>V: verified state
        V-->>O: completed / failed
        O->>R: save Action result; Run → succeeded / partial
    else rejected or unattended
        U-->>O: reject / no response
        O->>R: Action → rejected / skipped; Run → succeeded
    end

    O->>R: derive reviewable knowledge candidates
    R-->>S: report + snapshot + analysis + trace + run/actions
